title: call
---
<<if $contracts_completed == 0>>
Mara: The car outside the safehouse is yours to borrow. Open Contracts when you're ready.
Mara: Bay Supply has our first package.
<<elseif not $permit_owned>>
Mara: Mike can sell you a loading permit. Faster handovers, fewer questions.
<<else>>
Mara: Quiet week. Keep it that way.
<<endif>>
===

title: first_run_brief
---
Mara: Take my car. Sealed cargo at Bay Supply.
Mara: Wait for a quiet handover and there's a bonus in it. Force a fast pickup and the police come with it.
Mara: Bring it home clean — no heat on you at my door.
===

title: first_run_paid
---
Mara: Clean work. Money's in your pocket.
Mara: Mike's been asking about you. Check the board.
===

title: closing_window_brief
---
Mara: My runner is waiting at the canal bay. Armed response is already on the way.
Mara: From pickup you have two and a half minutes to get them to me. Plan the route before you go.
===

title: closing_window_paid
---
Mara: They're inside. You've got a future in this, Sam.
===
